A vast crystalline network of interconnected translucent spheres floating in deep space, each sphere containing miniature cityscapes glowing with warm amber and cool blue lights, connected by delicate golden bridges and pathways that pulse with energy. The spheres vary in size, with three prominent larger ones in the foreground representing different tiers of connection. The composition suggests hierarchy and access levels through the varying brightness and complexity of the internal city structures. Stars and nebulae swirl in the background, creating depth. Photorealistic style with dramatic lighting, shallow depth of field focusing on the central cluster, cinematic atmosphere with rich contrast between the warm internal glows and the cold void of space.
